<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 11.5 trln rbls in T-bills May 7.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 11.5 trln rbls in T-bills May 7.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will offer four trillion roubles in 161-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22082) and 7.5 trillion roubles in 364-day T-bills (series 23006) on May 7, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auctions follow:  </p>
<p>Full details of the 161-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		 22082</p>
<p>    Issue volume		  4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		 1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date		    May 7, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			   161 day</p>
<p>    Maturity date		 Oct 15, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 364-day auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		 23006</p>
<p>    Issue volume		  7.50 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		 1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date		    May 7, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			   364 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		 May 6, 1998</p>
<p>On May 7 the Finance Ministry will also repay about 7.25 trillion roubles in maturing issue of 140-day T-bills (series 22063).</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
